                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Note:</hi> The following factors have been considered in
                    arriving at the proposed basic quotas: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Average total exports from each country during recent years.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Average exports to United States during recent years.</item>
                        <pb facs="0411" n="399" xml:id="pg399"/>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Requirements of United States market for special types of
                            coffee.</item>
                        <label>4.</label>
                        <item>Normal markets for each country’s coffee.</item>
                        <label>5.</label>
                        <item>Abnormal conditions due to war.</item>
                    </list></p>
